efault\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Is that number got curves?</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/98/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F.png/revision/latest?cb=20251016213210\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Is that number got curves?\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/98/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251016213210\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/98/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251016213210 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/98/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F.png/revision/latest?cb=20251016213210 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Is that number got curves?\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Is_that_number_got_curves%3F.png\" data-image-name=\"Is that number got curves?.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">20</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bats,_bats,_hang_up.\" title=\"Bats, bats, hang up.\">Bats, bats, hang up.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drier_than_you_think,_chalk.\" title=\"Drier than you think, chalk.\">Drier than you think, chalk.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Is that number got curves?</b></i> is the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">Series 20</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 16 October 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a> asks <a href=\"/wiki/Quentin_Davies\" title=\"Quentin Davies\">Quentin Davies</a> \"Is that number got curves?\" during the <a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_age_of_the_mystery_person\" title=\"Find the age of the mystery person\">Find the age of the mystery person</a> task. It is the second episode in the series to get its title from Ania jumbling her words in the studio. The title card is of two flippers, with the number 10 made out of string on top of them. The flippers reference the <a href=\"/wiki/Wear_the_flippers_correctly\" title=\"Wear the flippers correctly\">Wear the flippers correctly</a> task, while the number 10 made out of string references both the <a href=\"/wiki/Cut_a_single_string_to_cause_the_greatest_effect\" title=\"Cut a single string to cause the greatest effect\">Cut a single string to cause the greatest effect</a> task, and the first part of the <a href=\"/wiki/Communicate_your_story_to_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Communicate your story to the Taskmaster\">Communicate your story to the Taskmaster</a> task.</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>The race for <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a>' gorgeous golden head remains extremely close as we enter the second half of the series. Highlights this time include <a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a> building a ladder out of chopsticks, <a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a> lassoing a weathervane and <a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</a> attempting to crush an egg. Meanwhile, <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> is forced to give up his prized watch, <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a>'s sunny disposition costs him dear and <a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a> hits a new low.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/20/6/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ania Magliano</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Maisie Adam</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Ellis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Reece Shearsmith</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_thing_Greg_would_most_like_to_see_Alex_wearing\" title=\"The thing Greg would most like to see Alex wearing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The thing Greg would most like to see Alex wearing.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Cut_a_single_string_to_cause_the_greatest_effect\" title=\"Cut a single string to cause the greatest effect\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Cut a single string to cause the greatest effect.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Communicate_your_story_to_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Communicate your story to the Taskmaster\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Write an autobiographical 10-word story.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Communicate your story to the Taskmaster. You may not leave the bridge.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wear_the_flippers_correctly\" title=\"Wear the flippers correctly\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Wear the flippers correctly.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Every time you say \"flipper\", \"flippers\" or \"flower\", your time is halved. Every time one of your feet leaves the circle, your time is halved. Every time you laugh, your time is halved. You must put the flippers on within 10 actual minutes of entering this room or you will be disqualified. After reading this, you must immediately return to the circle and the flippers must be where they were when you entered this room.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_age_of_the_mystery_person\" title=\"Find the age of the mystery person\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Find the age of the mystery person. You must stay on your seats at all times. You may ask one question at a time, going from oldest to youngest and you may only say two numbers each. The person may only say yes or no.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">16\n</td>\n<td>8\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow norefer